<h1>Workflow Graph Anatomy</h1>
<p class="lede">How the supervised two-worker LangGraph pipeline is built: the modules, the nine-node graph, what each CLI command does to the run directory, how Git snapshots and verification worktrees work, and how a crashed step is resumed without relaunching a Claude session.</p>

