<h2 id="graph">3. The graph itself</h2>
<p><code>build_pipeline()</code> wires nine nodes. Each node is a tiny closure that calls one <code>Pipeline</code> method and returns the state keys it produced. Three nodes contain an <code>interrupt()</code>, which is where the graph pauses and waits for a human.</p>

